# SHA-256 of the prebuilt frameworks committed under addons/godot-iap/bin/
# and the Android archives committed under addons/godot-iap/android/.
# CI builds the frameworks in job `apple-frameworks` in ci-godot-iap.yml
# and uploads them as an artifact; the maintainer commits that artifact.
# `bun run audit:godot-binaries` verifies the committed files against this
# manifest — the release runs it as a deploy gate
# (release-godot.yml validate-ios) and CI re-runs it on main/next pushes and
# PRs to fail earlier. macOS digests pin pre-signing bytes: notarized
# releases re-sign those frameworks before zipping, so shipped macOS bytes
# differ by design.
#
# Regenerate after an intentional rebuild:
#   node scripts/audit-godot-binary-digests.mjs --write
fe3c1d3cc09c3799354deea6493e4cdd342cb2321b81f7ddbac467487a3cc88b  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.debug.aar
25a744fa8f1e6d1708c13808b8e1b2f33d601460168f38fbb75f429a7ef404d2  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.release.aar
0283d80dc8851b2af02f4621018f3d09799bf967e82f32d10554b6c43f167c62  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
3b8517c19e42897bb852510d5e24ca7c83412e1419637c721b78eaa28e63a87c  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
bb4f8628a96d4ba3c7cc5854070e8eb51fec88197542c5688db54cc7e4f5031d  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
b2d56270f009e49ed5f63ed15178950952dcb43b90b8a545cd16f99767820abb  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
